## Arithmetic Intensity-Aware PIM-GPU Operator Scheduling（算术强度感知的PIM-GPU算子调度）

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Arithmetic Intensity-Aware Operator Scheduling是SADDLE提出的一种运行时operator-to-device动态映射机制，用于PIM+GPU异构systems上的speculative decoding。核心思想：speculative decoding中draft length变化和effective micro-batch size变化会动态改变operator的arithmetic intensity (FLOPs/Byte)，使离线确定的static mapping失效。SADDLE的Scheduler在运行时根据当前effective micro-batch size和draft token count估算operator arithmetic intensity，与预标定的PIM compute-bound和GPU memory-bound threshold比较，动态决定operator在PIM还是GPU执行。初始固定映射：DLM attention → PIM（每iteration 1 token/request，arithmetic intensity极低，天然memory-bound）；TLM FC → GPU（Shared Pool聚合token后compute-bound，适合GPU GEMM）。动态映射：DLM FC和TLM attention。

从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。
Scheduler的决策伪代码：
```
// 系统初始化：预标定PIM和GPU的roofline参数
PIM_peak_compute = measure_pim_tflops()
PIM_peak_bandwidth = measure_pim_bw()
GPU_peak_compute = measure_gpu_tflops()
GPU_peak_bandwidth = measure_gpu_bw()

// Ridge points（PIM compute-bound vs GPU memory-bound过渡点）
PIM_ridge_CI = PIM_peak_compute / PIM_peak_bandwidth
GPU_ridge_CI = GPU_peak_compute / GPU_peak_bandwidth

// 动态调度：每次prediction后
function schedule_DLM_FC():
    active_requests = count_requests_with_H_t_above_threshold()
    eff_batch_size = active_requests

    // 估算DLM FC arithmetic intensity
    // FC GEMM: output[batch, hidden] = input[batch, hidden] × weight[hidden, hidden]
    flops = 2 * eff_batch_size * d_model^2
    bytes = (eff_batch_size * d_model + d_model^2) * elem_size  // input + weight
    CI = flops / bytes

    if CI < PIM_ridge_CI:
        return "PIM"  // memory-bound, PIM更高效
    else:
        return "GPU"  // compute/bw-bound, GPU更高效

// 动态调度：每次verification前
function schedule_TLM_attention():
    // 统计Shared Pool中每请求的draft token数
    total_tokens = SharedPool.token_count()
    avg_tokens_per_req = total_tokens / SharedPool.request_count()

    // Attention arithmetic intensity: O(seq_len * d_head^2) / O(seq_len * d_head)
    // draft_length增加 → seq_len增加 → CI增加
    flops_attn = 4 * total_tokens * d_head^2  // QK^T + softmax × V
    bytes_attn = 2 * total_tokens * d_head * elem_size  // KV cache reads
    CI_attn = flops_attn / bytes_attn

    if CI_attn > GPU_ridge_CI:
        return "GPU"
    else:
        return "PIM"

// 每speculative iteration执行一次
Scheduler.run()
```
关键观察（Fig.6 roofline analysis）：当draft length从1增至8，TLM attention arithmetic intensity提升，GPU性能超越PIM（即使operator仍memory-bound on GPU）。当micro-batch从12请求降至4请求（短draft请求完成），DLM FC arithmetic intensity从GPU带宽限制降到PIM计算限制区，optimal target从GPU变为PIM。

术语一般如何实现？如何使用？
SADDLE Scheduler在Manager中实现：预标定阶段离线测量每个device的peak compute和bandwidth→计算ridge point（CI阈值）。运行时Scheduler在每次prediction后和verification前执行：用活跃请求数和Shared Pool token数快速估算CI→与预标定阈值比较→决定operator映射。消融实验：启用动态operator scheduling的SADDLE-s比无scheduling的SADDLE-p吞吐再提升1.13×。无scheduling时SADDLE 9.51% ops在PIM/90.49%在GPU；启用后变为14.89%/85.11%，吞吐提升1.21×。该方法与SpecPIM的offline genetic algorithm/MCTS-based mapping和PAPI的dynamic profiling形成对比：SADDLE用轻量级CI估算替代完整profiling，仅需pre-characterized thresholds和简单代数运算。

